          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Calculate <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{100} n^3.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Calculate [MATH: \\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{100} n^3.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Using the formula</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\sum_{n=1}^N n^3 \t = \\frac{1}{4}N^2(N+1)^2]</span></p><p>with <span class=\"math\">[MATH: N=100,]</span> we get</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \u2211_(n = 1)^(100)n^{3}|= (1)/(4) \u22c5 100^{2}(100 + 1)^{2}; = (1)/(4) \u22c5 100^{2} \u22c5 101^{2}; = (1)/(4) \u22c5 10000 \u22c5 10201; = 25502500.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Using the formula\n\n[MATH: \\sum_{n=1}^N n^3 = \\frac{1}{4}N^2(N+1)^2]\n\nwith [MATH: N=100,] we get\n\n[MATH: \u2211_(n = 1)^(100)n^{3}|= (1)/(4) \u22c5 100^{2}(100 + 1)^{2}; = (1)/(4) \u22c5 100^{2} \u22c5 101^{2}; = (1)/(4) \u22c5 10000 \u22c5 10201; = 25502500.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
